# ─── Caddy Cloudflare DNS-01 token — INFRA NODE ONLY ───
# This file is intentionally NOT managed by gen-env / the root .env, so the
# Cloudflare token never propagates to other nodes. On the infra node only:
#
#   cp cloudflare.env.example cloudflare.env
#   $EDITOR cloudflare.env        # paste the token
#   docker compose up -d --build
#
# Create the token at https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens with:
#   - Permissions: Zone → DNS → Edit, and Zone → Zone → Read
#   - Zone Resources: Include → Specific zone → <your domain>
#
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
